Chapter: MauiStubs
  cites UI chapter Theme
  cites UI chapter Widget

 Stub declarations for MAUI plug runtime functions. The compiler
 sees these as default implementations; the plug's C# runtime
 provides the real ones and is-maui-builtin suppresses these defs.

